        "bug_id": "BUG-001",
        "title": "OOB_SIGNEDNESS_MISMATCH_IN_INDEX_CHECK",
        "root_cause": {
          "type": "Signedness Error",
          "description": "edit_cookie and read_cookie read the cookie index via scanf(\"%llu\") as unsigned long long, but validate it against cookie_num using a signed comparison (jl / 'jump if less', signed). When the user supplies a value with bit 63 set (e.g. 0x8000000000000000), the value is interpreted as a large negative number in the signed comparison, so 'idx < cookie_num' evaluates to true and the bounds check is bypassed. The index is then used to access the msg[] and msg_size[] global arrays without any lower-bound validation, resulting in out-of-bounds array access."
        },
        "affected_functions": [
          "edit_cookie",
          "read_cookie"
        ],
        "affected_objects": [
          "msg[0..31] at 0x4060 (char* array, 256 bytes)",
          "msg_size[0..31] at 0x4160 (int array, 128 bytes)",
          "stdout at 0x4020 (FILE*)",
          "stdin at 0x4030 (FILE*)",
          "stderr at 0x4040 (FILE*)",
          "urandom at 0x41e0 (FILE*)",
          "cookie_num at 0x41e8 (long)"
        ],
        "attack_surface": {
          "input": "cookie_index via scanf(\"%llu\") in edit_cookie and read_cookie",
          "entry_function": "main",
          "data_flow": [
            "User input via stdin -> scanf(\"%llu\", &idx) stores unsigned long long at stack [rbp-0x10]",
            "idx loaded into rdx at 0x1676 (edit_cookie) / 0x179f (read_cookie)",
            "cookie_num loaded into rax at 0x167a (edit_cookie) / 0x17a3 (read_cookie)",
            "cmp rdx, rax; jl _abort — signed comparison at 0x1681/0x1684 (edit_cookie) / 0x17aa/0x17ad (read_cookie)",
            "If bit 63 of idx is set: signed interpretation is negative, jl passes, bounds check bypassed",
            "In edit_cookie: msg_size[idx] read at 0x16a7-0x16b6 (lea rdx,[rax*4]; lea rax,msg_size; mov eax,[rdx+rax]) — OOB read from msg_size array",
            "In edit_cookie: msg_size[idx]-1 sign-extended via movsxd at 0x16bc, used as read() size at 0x16de",
            "In edit_cookie: msg[idx] read at 0x16c3-0x16d2 (lea rcx,[rax*8]; lea rax,msg; mov rax,[rcx+rax]) — OOB read of pointer from msg array",
            "In edit_cookie: read(0, msg[idx], msg_size[idx]-1) at 0x16de — OOB write to whatever address was read from msg[idx]",
            "In read_cookie: msg[idx] read at 0x17bb-0x17ce — OOB read of pointer",
